WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.319
Week 31: Comparison, Register, and Idiomatic Force. make a nuanced comparison praise or criticize appropriately interpret idioms from context

2
00:00:10.319 --> 00:00:18.121
Mission brief. Compare two proposals in formal language, then interpret an informal reaction containing idioms.

3
00:00:18.121 --> 00:00:27.505
Preparation. Select ten useful words, three linking expressions, and two repair phrases. Plan points rather than a memorized paragraph.

4
00:00:27.505 --> 00:00:35.200
Performance. Complete the task once for fluency, review the evidence, then repeat it for greater clarity and accuracy.

5
00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:43.642
After-action review. Record what succeeded, what blocked communication, and the single change that will matter most on the next attempt.

6
00:00:43.642 --> 00:01:14.273
Model language. Voy a comparar dos propuestas formalmente. — I am going to compare two proposals formally. Después interpreto una reacción informal. — Then I interpret an informal reaction. Distingo el significado literal del figurado. — I distinguish the literal meaning from the figurative one. Deduzco el sentido por el contexto. — I deduce the meaning from context. Explico el matiz con un ejemplo. — I explain the nuance with an example.

7
00:01:14.273 --> 00:01:24.022
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
